SDK revision: 1 (20Apr2004Patch1 / May 21, 2004)

Imported implementations for the existing Dolphin translation units, their
private headers, and the upstream public/support headers under include/.
All imported objects remain NonMatching. The normal link continues to use
original objects; all_source compiles the imported implementations for objdiff.
No prototype matching or runtime equivalence is claimed.

Paths adapted to the existing split/configuration names:
  src/base/PPCArch.c -> src/Dolphin/PPCArch.c
  src/ai/ai.c -> src/Dolphin/ai.c
  src/db/db.c -> src/Dolphin/db.c
  src/os/OSSemaphore.c -> src/Dolphin/os/OSSem.c
  src/os/__ppc_eabi_init.c -> src/Dolphin/os/__ppc_eabi_init.cpp (compiled as C)
  src/dvd/dvdFatal.c -> src/Dolphin/dvd/dvdfatal.c
Other selected source paths gain the Dolphin/ prefix.

Upstream has no implementations for the existing IP, THP, or OdemuExi2 units.
Those remain scaffolds, as do the separate Revolution WPAD/KPAD units.

Local header integration changes:
  include/libc/stddef.h: size_t uses unsigned long, consistent with include/types.h.
  include/dolphin/card.h: rename parameters named new for C++ compatibility.
  include/libc/wchar.h: do not redefine the built-in C++ wchar_t.
  include/dolphin/types.h: use a C++-compatible NULL definition.
  Imported text: remove trailing whitespace and normalize final newlines.
